  <description>
    <p>Model it once. Every shop drawing follows. DetailCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in DetailCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Move around the 3D view</li>
      <li>The view cube</li>
      <li>Explore the sample frame</li>
      <li>Set up grids and levels</li>
      <li>Shear tabs</li>
      <li>Place columns, beams and braces</li>
      <li>Select by window, move, rotate, mirror, change many</li>
      <li>Copy, paste and duplicate</li>
      <li>Phases</li>
      <li>Check for clashes</li>
      <li>Place plates and add custom profiles</li>
      <li>Material and weight report by phase</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
